# Desktop client

- Windows desktop is allowed. Prefer Tauri wrapping the existing Web UI.
- Use native playback (mpv / FFmpeg or OS decoders) only when the browser cannot decode the stream (DTS / TrueHD / similar).
- Do not add Electron, iOS, Flutter, or KMP unless the user explicitly changes that again.
- Desktop uses the same OpenAPI contract. Do not proxy media bytes through Media Hub.
